(result, term);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        out.println(result);\n        out.close();\n    }\n\n    static class Mod998 {\n        private static final long MOD = 998244353L;\n        private long[] factorial;\n        private long[] invFactorial;\n        \n        public void init(int size) {\n            factorial = new long[size];\n            invFactorial = new long[size];\n            \n            factorial[0] = 1;\n            for (int i = 1; i < size; i++) {\n                factorial[i] = (factorial[i - 1] * i) % MOD;\n            }\n            \n            invFactorial[size - 1] = modPow(factorial[size - 1], MOD - 2);\n            for (int i = size - 2; i >= 0; i--) {\n                invFactorial[i] = (invFactorial[i + 1] * (i + 1)) % MOD;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        public long binomial(int n, int r) {\n            if (r < 0 || r > n) return 0;\n            return (factorial[n] * invFactorial[r] % MOD) * invFactorial[n - r] % MOD;\n        }\n        \n        public long modInverse(int x) {\n            return modPow(x, MOD - 2);\n        }\n        \n        public long modPow(long base, long exp) {\n            long res = 1;\n            base %= MOD;\n            while (exp > 0) {\n                if ((exp & 1) == 1) res = (res * base) % MOD;\n                base = (base * base) % MOD;\n                exp >>= 1;\n            }\n            return res;\n        }\n        \n        public long sum(long a, long b) {\n            a += b;\n            return a >= MOD ? a - MOD : a;\n        }\n        \n        public long diff(long a, long b) {\n            a -= b;\n            return a < 0 ? a + MOD : a;\n        }\n        \n        public long multiply(long a, long b) {\n            return (a * b) % MOD;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class InputReader {\n        private BufferedReader reader;\n        private StringTokenizer tokenizer;\n\n        public InputReader(InputStream stream) {\n            reader = n